cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Decay of correlations and thermodynamic limit for the circular Riesz gas: a Lean 4 formalization"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/jboursier/circular-riesz-gas-correlations-lean"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the main results of the paper
  "Decay of correlations and thermodynamic limit for the circular Riesz gas": long-range
  and short-range gap correlation estimates, the thermodynamic limit and quantitative
  convergence of labelled gaps, hyperuniformity of the long-range limit and repulsion
  under the Palm law. The results cover every positive inverse temperature in their
  respective ranges of positive Riesz exponents different from one. The development
  imports the companion formalization as Riesz1. The library contains no sorry and no
  custom axiom, and each of the six main results has a Mathlib-only comparator challenge.
authors:
